# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile given to -f.
# The build context is the repo root (build_and_push.sh), so these patterns are
# repo-root-relative. The image needs only tools/__init__.py, tools/ingestion/
# and the docker/ files the Dockerfile copies.
*
!tools/__init__.py
!tools/ingestion/
tools/ingestion/tests/
tools/ingestion/chunking_test/
tools/ingestion/ops/*.json
tools/ingestion/ops/.regression_env.sh
tools/ingestion/.ingest-case-law-progress.json
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
